scn 1
# Three Drakes (Crusades) guard a Goblin that dies (air_traffic kills it at tick 300). VTOL_Follow, the
# guard's last mission, inserts VTOL_SeekGuard (4191d7) at the Goblin's last point: it circles there at the
# selected weapon's range + 160 px, steps out of a stack at every wake (4198fd), and guards the first allied
# unit that cannot fly within its sightdistance (509ac0 / 421910; 4de530 action 7: VTOL_FOLLOW) -- one of the
# Goblins standing in a ring round the point. Through protocol 307's first cut the guard just ended and the
# Drakes stood down.
name air-guard-lost
ticks 900
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
type gob fbi zongob
group drakes 0 drake 3 cells 20,78 20,80 20,82
group ward 0 gob 1 cells 60,80
group ring 0 gob 16 cells 60,112 72,110 83,103 90,92 92,80 90,68 83,57 72,50 60,48 48,50 37,57 30,68 28,80 30,92 37,103 48,110
at 2 guard drakes @ward
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
